    slug: "closed-loop-geothermal-supercritical-co-working",
    title: { zh: "超临界CO₂工质的闭环地热", en: "Closed-Loop Geothermal with Supercritical CO₂ Working Fluid" },
    qfocus: { zh: "超临界 CO₂ 作闭环地热工质，能否在真实深储层里同时跑通取热与永久封存？", en: "Can supercritical CO₂ as a closed-loop geothermal working fluid deliver heat extraction and permanent sequestration at once in a real deep reservoir?" },
    domain: "物质",
    cluster: { code: "C17", zh: "新能源范式", en: "New energy paradigms" },
    scores: [4, 5, 3, 2, 3, 2, 4, 3, 4],
    citation: {
      url: "https://www.powermag.com/eavors-first-of-its-kind-closed-loop-geothermal-project-produces-grid-power-in-germany/",
      title: "Eavor's First-of-Its-Kind Closed-Loop Geothermal Project Produces Grid Power in Germany",
      venue: "POWER Magazine",
      year: 2025,
    },
    brief: { zh: "在真实储层条件下循环超临界 CO₂ 取热：测密度差驱动的自然虹吸能省下多少泵耗，跟踪 CO₂—卤水—矿物反应究竟是稳定封存还是堵塞流道，并把闭环受限的换热面积折算成功率密度与度电成本。", en: "Circulate supercritical CO₂ for heat extraction under real reservoir conditions: measure how much pumping load the density-driven self-siphon saves, track whether CO₂–brine–mineral reactions stabilize storage or clog flow paths, and convert the heat-exchange area a closed loop allows into power density and cost per kilowatt-hour." },
    literature: [
      { title: "Research Progress on CO2 as Geothermal Working Fluid: A Review", venue: "Energies (MDPI)", year: 2024, url: "https://www.mdpi.com/1996-1073/17/21/5415" },
      { title: "Integrated modelling of CO2 plume geothermal energy systems in carbonate reservoirs: technology, operations, economics and sustainability", venue: "Renewable Energy (Elsevier)", year: 2024, url: "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0960148124012308" },
    ],
    depth: {
      overview: { zh: "把取热工质从水换成超临界 CO₂：它几乎不溶解矿物因而少结垢，密度差驱动的自然虹吸减少泵耗，循环的同时又把 CO₂ 永久留在储层里。配合不与地层流体交换的闭环回路，它绕开了水基地热的结垢与诱发地震两大顽疾——发电与碳封存被耦合进同一个循环。", en: "Swap the heat carrier from water to supercritical CO₂: it barely dissolves minerals and so scales little, its density contrast drives a self-siphon that cuts pumping load, and circulating it leaves CO₂ permanently in the reservoir. Paired with a closed loop that exchanges no formation fluid, it sidesteps both chronic ailments of water-based geothermal — scaling and induced seismicity — coupling power generation and carbon storage into one circuit." },
      whyMatters: { zh: "水基地热的结垢与诱发地震两大顽疾都出在工质上，换成 CO₂ 等于同时拆两颗雷；但闭环地热虽已有首个项目在德国并网发电，CO₂ 工质这一支仍停在综述、集成建模与岩心实验阶段。", en: "Both chronic ailments of water-based geothermal — scaling and induced seismicity — trace back to the working fluid, so switching to CO₂ defuses two problems at once. Yet while closed-loop geothermal already has a first-of-its-kind project delivering grid power in Germany, the CO₂-working-fluid branch remains at the stage of reviews, integrated modelling, and core experiments." },
      ifAnswered: { zh: "基荷电力与永久碳封存可以在同一口井里同时完成，地热选址不再受限于必须存在天然渗透率的水热储层。", en: "Baseload power and permanent carbon storage could be delivered from the same well, and geothermal siting would no longer be confined to hydrothermal reservoirs that must already possess natural permeability." },
      approaches: [
        { zh: "分别以 CO₂ 增强地热与 CO₂ 羽流地热两条路线做储层尺度的对比评估。", en: "Evaluate the CO₂-enhanced-geothermal and CO₂-plume-geothermal routes comparatively at reservoir scale." },
        { zh: "对碳酸盐储层做技术—运行—经济—可持续四维的集成建模。", en: "Build integrated models of carbonate reservoirs across the four dimensions of technology, operations, economics, and sustainability." },
        { zh: "用超临界 CO₂ 与水分别作压裂液做岩心实验，比较裂缝形态与矿物反应。", en: "Run core experiments using supercritical CO₂ versus water as fracturing fluid, comparing fracture morphology and mineral reaction." },
      ],
      barrier: { zh: "CO₂ 与卤水反应生成的碳酸盐矿物既可能锁死封存也可能堵死流道，两种结局在实验室岩心上难以区分，而闭环受限的换热面积又压着功率密度与经济性。", en: "Carbonate minerals formed by CO₂–brine reaction may either lock the storage in or clog the flow paths, and the two outcomes are hard to tell apart on laboratory cores — while the heat-exchange area a closed loop permits keeps pressing down on power density and economics." },
      subQuestions: [
        { zh: "碳酸盐沉淀在多长的运行时间尺度上，开始显著改变闭环回路的渗流与换热？", en: "Over what operating timescale does carbonate precipitation begin to significantly alter flow and heat transfer in a closed loop?" },
        { zh: "自然虹吸究竟能抵消多少泵耗，其贡献随井深与储层温度如何变化？", en: "How much pumping load does the self-siphon actually offset, and how does its contribution vary with well depth and reservoir temperature?" },
        { zh: "在闭环受限的换热面积下，CO₂ 动力循环的热电转换效率能否追平水系统？", en: "Under the heat-exchange area a closed loop allows, can the CO₂ power cycle's thermal-to-electric conversion efficiency catch up with water systems?" },
      ],
    },
