    slug: "de-novo-design-transmembrane-pores",
    title: { zh: "从头设计跨膜孔道与选择性运输", en: "De Novo Design of Transmembrane Pores and Selective Transport" },
    qfocus: { zh: "从头设计的跨膜孔能否从一个「导电的洞」，走到有方向性与能量耦合的主动转运体？", en: "Can a de novo transmembrane pore progress from a conducting hole to a directional, energy-coupled active transporter?" },
    domain: "物质",
    cluster: { code: "C43", zh: "生成式生物·AI分子与蛋白设计", en: "Generative Biology · AI Molecular & Protein Design" },
    scores: [5, 5, 5, 2, 4, 2, 4, 4, 4],
    citation: {
      url: "https://doi.org/10.1126/science.adn3796",
      title: "Sculpting conducting nanopore size and shape through de novo protein design",
      venue: "Science",
      year: 2024,
    },
    brief: { zh: "在成分明确的脂质体系里联合测结构、插入效率、单通道电流、离子与溶质选择性和泄漏，把孔径、形状与寡聚计量做成可编程变量，逐步逼近带门控的定向转运。", en: "In lipid systems of defined composition, jointly measure structure, insertion efficiency, single-channel current, ion and solute selectivity, and leakage; make pore diameter, shape, and oligomeric stoichiometry programmable variables, and work stepwise toward gated, directional transport." },
    literature: [
      { title: "Computational design of transmembrane pores", venue: "Nature", year: 2020, url: "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-020-2646-5" },
      { title: "Water, Solute, and Ion Transport in De Novo-Designed Membrane Protein Channels", venue: "ACS Nano", year: 2024, url: "https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.4c11317" },
    ],
    depth: {
      overview: { zh: "跨膜孔道把生成式蛋白设计从可溶性蛋白推到膜上：2020 年 Nature 首次从头设计出结构可核验的跨膜孔，2024 年 Science 证明孔径与形状可编程并测得电导，ACS Nano 又把水、溶质与离子通量纳入实验与模拟对照，形成膜插入—几何—传输的直接证据链。", en: "Transmembrane pores push generative protein design off soluble proteins and into the membrane: Nature 2020 produced the first de novo transmembrane pore with verifiable structure, Science 2024 showed that pore diameter and shape are programmable and measured the resulting conductance, and ACS Nano brought water, solute, and ion flux into paired experiment and simulation — forming a direct evidence chain from insertion through geometry to transport." },
      whyMatters: { zh: "选择性运输是活细胞的边界能力，能设计它就能造传感器、分离膜与合成细胞；但目前能编程的只是几何与被动通量，而非生命真正依赖的方向性主动转运。", en: "Selective transport is what a living cell does at its boundary; designing it opens sensors, separation membranes, and synthetic cells. What is programmable today, however, is geometry and passive flux — not the directional active transport life actually depends on." },
      ifAnswered: { zh: "可按需求定制离子与溶质选择性的膜元件，测序纳米孔、分离膜与合成细胞的边界不再受限于天然蛋白骨架。", en: "Membrane components with ion and solute selectivity to order would follow, freeing sequencing nanopores, separation membranes, and synthetic-cell boundaries from the scaffolds nature happens to supply." },
      approaches: [
        { zh: "以从头设计雕刻孔径与形状，在平面脂双层上测单通道电流与电导。", en: "Sculpt pore diameter and shape by de novo design, and measure single-channel current and conductance in planar lipid bilayers." },
        { zh: "在成分明确的脂质体中同时测水、溶质与离子通量，并与分子动力学对照。", en: "Measure water, solute, and ion flux together in liposomes of defined composition, and compare against molecular dynamics." },
        { zh: "系统改变膜组成、取向与寡聚计量，量化它们对选择性与泄漏的影响。", en: "Vary membrane composition, orientation, and oligomeric stoichiometry systematically, quantifying their effect on selectivity and leakage." },
      ],
      barrier: { zh: "电导与被动扩散只说明孔是通的，不等于存在能量耦合与构象循环的方向性转运；膜组成、取向与寡聚计量又会同时改写读数，仅凭分子动力学或细胞毒性推不出机制。", en: "Conductance and passive diffusion show only that the pore is open, not that energy-coupled, conformationally cycling directional transport exists; membrane composition, orientation, and oligomeric stoichiometry rewrite the readouts at the same time, and neither molecular dynamics nor cytotoxicity alone can establish a transport mechanism." },
      subQuestions: [
        { zh: "设计孔的实际寡聚计量与取向分布，能否在膜中被直接定量而非假定？", en: "Can a designed pore's actual oligomeric stoichiometry and orientation distribution be quantified directly in the membrane rather than assumed?" },
        { zh: "把构象循环写进设计目标之后，能否得到净方向性通量而非双向扩散？", en: "Once conformational cycling is written into the design objective, does net directional flux emerge rather than bidirectional diffusion?" },
        { zh: "离子选择性的设计极限由孔径决定，还是由孔壁电荷与脱水代价决定？", en: "Is the design ceiling on ion selectivity set by pore diameter, or by pore-wall charge and the cost of dehydration?" },
      ],
    },
